Command: d
Effect : delete characters from current line
Modes  : x, x-y, x@y, <string>

Examples:
d 5     - delete 5 characters starting at current character pointer
d 3-10  - delete characters 3 through 10 inclusive
d 6@50  - delete 6 characters starting with character 50
d <str> - delete the next occurence of the string <str> on the current line

Also see the help on strings.
